    Deactivate sonar on travis (#984)
    
    * Deactivate sonar on travis
    
    The key is currently not correct. Until this is fixed, deactivate
    this check.
    
    Refs: https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/issues/959
    
    * Use Node.js 10 on travis
    
    Node.js v9 is not supported for a long time. Using Node.js v10
    is the current oldest supported Node.js version.
    
    * Update correctly deactivate Sonar on Travis CI #959
    
    Co-authored-by: Ben Willenbring <ben-willenbring@t-online.de>

